                                "example_id": "0092f343-cdbb-4b02-be14-97ad334d599a",
                                "sense_id": "c2c6b7ff-4972-3d89-b18b-b43693b30184",
                                "text": "Anapeiratic paralyses are those due to excessive use of certain muscles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3e92799-e79d-4591-b286-17f42f4ab7fe",
                                "sense_id": "c2c6b7ff-4972-3d89-b18b-b43693b30184",
                                "text": "\"It is,\" said Dr. Buccom, \" what Dr. Hammond terms anapeiratic paralysis, where the organs most used are the ones affected, such as writer's or telegrapher's paralysis.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82c90a93-a79e-4754-bf6c-fa9aad25357c",
                                "sense_id": "c2c6b7ff-4972-3d89-b18b-b43693b30184",
                                "text": "A somewhat randydandy in the past I came by the usual passes and frenzies and anapeiratic fatigue to that final pass and found myself in harness with a woman for whom, the long and lively honeymoon over, I not only had no desire but had also no patience, neither, even experiencing (a luxury for Riley) a positive sexual aversion."
                            }
                        ]
